  "description": "ExtensionMethodsSourceGenerator is a Roslyn-based source generator that automatically produces extension methods from classes marked with the [ToExtensionMethod] attribute. By scanning your code for public/internal static methods that have at least one parameter, it generates .g.cs files containing the corresponding extension methods. This allows you to call those methods in a more fluent, extension-like syntax without manually duplicating code.",
